{
  "Unbound runs a SetActive's OnDisable and OnEnable in hierarchy pre-order (each GameObject's components in order); the Editor runs OnDisable in hierarchy post-order (children before their parent, C1's subtree before C2, components in order) and OnEnable in the order the behaviours were created, across the hierarchy. Not changed yet: scene-loaded and instantiated hierarchies, which take the same path, are not measured (README)": [
    "add.off",
    "add.on",
    "addHierarchy.off",
    "created.off",
    "late.off",
    "late.on",
    "reactivated.off",
    "reactivated.on",
    "reenabled.off",
    "reenabled.on",
    "two.off",
    "two.on"
  ]
}
